our paper look exactly like this document. The easiest way to do this is to simply remove the \'93instructional\'94 content in one of the templates and add your own text.
\par }{We have templates for FrameMaker, MS Word, and LaTeX. These templates have styles defined that will aid you in conforming to these formatting instructions.
