ould begin with an abstract, followed by a set of keywords; the abstract and keywords should be placed the left column of the first page under the left half of the title. The abstract should be a concise statement of the problem, approach and findings of 
the work reported.
\par }\pard\plain \s1\qj \li0\ri0\sl-200\slmult0\keepn\nowidctlpar\faauto\outlinelevel0\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\caps\f5\fs18\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {SUBSEQUENT PAGES
